CNGMWA.PA CHANGES THE SIZE OF THE MANUSCRIPT
WORKING AREA FOR SCOPE.  THE NUMBER OF BLOCKS IS
TYPED ON THE COMMAND DECODER LINE, IMMEDIATELY
AFTER THE OUTPUT FILENAME:
 
*SCOPE.SV[230]<
 
SCOPE.SV MUST BE ON SYS:, AND THE NEW COPY OF
SCOPE WILL BE PUT ON DSK:.
 
MAXIMUM IS ABOUT 232 BLOCKS.
